  "title": "Procedural objection — the pieces of pausing a question with a supplied intervention, and their relationships",
  "titleEs": "Objeción procesal — Mecanismo o relación explicada",
  "category": "hearings",
  "categoryName": "Audiencias y desarrollo del juicio",
